  "id": "a-posteriori",
  "term": "a posteriori",
  "definition": "A posteriori refers to ideas or reasoning that depend on experience. In this contrast, it is opposed to a priori thought and is associated with inductive reasoning rather than deduction from what is taken to be already given in the mind.",
